     "id": "8c199e17",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "html",
     "settings": {
      "html": "<section class=\"band--navy\" data-el=\"news.impact\" data-el-build=\"custom-widget\">\n  <div class=\"wrap section\">\n    <div class=\"section-head reveal\"><h2 class=\"h2\">Impact dashboard.</h2><p class=\"body-lg\" style=\"color:#E7E4DC\">Future architecture. Every figure below stays blank until it is verified, and projections will be labelled as projections rather than shown as results.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"hairline\" style=\"--min:240px\" data-stagger>\n      <div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:150px;gap:12px\"><span class=\"metric__value\" aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><span class=\"metric__label\">Individuals and families supported<span class=\"sr-only\">: not yet verified</span></span><span class=\"metric__state\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Not yet verified</span></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:150px;gap:12px\"><span class=\"metric__value\" aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><span class=\"metric__label\">Subsidized program hours<span class=\"sr-only\">: not yet verified</span></span><span class=\"metric__state\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Not yet verified</span></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:150px;gap:12px\"><span class=\"metric__value\" aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><span class=\"metric__label\">Inclusive sport hours<span class=\"sr-only\">: not yet verified</span></span><span class=\"metric__state\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Not yet verified</span></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:150px;gap:12px\"><span class=\"metric__value\" aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><span class=\"metric__label\">Education hours<span class=\"sr-only\">: not yet verified</span></span><span class=\"metric__state\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Not yet verified</span></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:150px;gap:12px\"><span class=\"metric__value\" aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><span class=\"metric__label\">Placements<span class=\"sr-only\">: not yet verified</span></span><span class=\"metric__state\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Not yet verified</span></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:150px;gap:12px\"><span class=\"metric__value\" aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><span class=\"metric__label\">Internships<span class=\"sr-only\">: not yet verified</span></span><span class=\"metric__state\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Not yet verified</span></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:150px;gap:12px\"><span class=\"metric__value\" aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><span class=\"metric__label\">Employers<span class=\"sr-only\">: not yet verified</span></span><span class=\"metric__state\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Not yet verified</span></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:150px;gap:12px\"><span class=\"metric__value\" aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><span class=\"metric__label\">Providers<span class=\"sr-only\">: not yet verified</span></span><span class=\"metric__state\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Not yet verified</span></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:150px;gap:12px\"><span class=\"metric__value\" aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><span class=\"metric__label\">Partners<span class=\"sr-only\">: not yet verified</span></span><span class=\"metric__state\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Not yet verified</span></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:150px;gap:12px\"><span class=\"metric__value\" aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><span class=\"metric__label\">Value of subsidized and in-kind services<span class=\"sr-only\">: not yet verified</span></span><span class=\"metric__state\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Not yet verified</span></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:150px;gap:12px\"><span class=\"metric__value\" aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><span class=\"metric__label\">Access Fund contributions<span class=\"sr-only\">: not yet verified</span></span><span class=\"metric__state\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Not yet verified</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
